  "description": "e-conomic Connector for DynamicWeb 10 and 9\n\nIntegrate e-conomic ERP seamlessly with DynamicWeb and automate your entire data flow between webshop and ERP. The connector transfers essential datasets from e-conomic to DynamicWeb, including users and user groups, product data, product groups, product units, standard prices, special prices and cost prices, ensuring that your webshop always reflects accurate and up-to-date commercial information.\n\nThe connector includes preconfigured integration flows that work out of the box, while also allowing customization to match your specific needs. You can control which fields to import, how frequently data is updated, and how orders are sent back to e-conomic.\n\nData also flows from DynamicWeb back into e-conomic, where orders and deliveries are transferred directly into the ERP system for processing, invoicing and bookkeeping. This bidirectional data exchange creates a streamlined and reliable workflow where product and pricing information originates in e-conomic, while order handling is driven from DynamicWeb with full financial synchronization.\n\nDeveloped for DynamicWeb 10.x and DynamicWeb 9.1x.x – contact Flex Media for details. Requires e-conomic API access and an active Flex Media license.\n\nRead more and get started: https://www.flex-media.dk/erp-integration/dynamicweb-economic-integration\n\nSupport: support@flexmedia.dk | +45 4817 6666 / +45 4422 8430",
